      ":question/problem": "Consider the following differential equation.\n\n$$\n4x{y}^{\u2033}+{y}^{\u2032}+5y=0\n$$\n\nLet $y={x}^{\\lambda }{\\sum }_{n=0}^{\\infty }{a}_{n}{x}^{n}$ be a Frobenius series solution about the regular singular point $x=0$ of the differential equation above.\nGiven that $\\lambda \\in (-\\frac{1}{2},\\frac{1}{2}),$ find the recurrence relation for the coefficients ${a}_{n},$ where $n=1,2,3,\u2026.$\n\n*Hint: Substituting the Frobenius series solution into each term of the ODE, we obtain*\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4x{y}^{\u2033} & =4({\\lambda }^{2}-\\lambda ){a}_{0}{x}^{\\lambda -1}+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }4((\\lambda +n)^{2}-(\\lambda +n)){a}_{n}{x}^{\\lambda +n-1}, \\\\ {y}^{\u2032} & =\\lambda {a}_{0}{x}^{\\lambda -1}+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }(\\lambda +n){a}_{n}{x}^{\\lambda +n-1} \\\\ 5y & ={\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }5{a}_{n-1}{x}^{\\lambda +n-1}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"
